  entries:
  - option: 0
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: d1693cf1644230e4b9d58568b33defe2, type: 3}
    header: Grab
    body: Point the controller at the object and press the Grab button to grab.
  - option: 1
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 981433469c0451a41b8e2d972c9da92e, type: 3}
    header: Pitch
    body: Move the right joystick up and down to control the drone's pitch.
  - option: 2
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: f849b24507069284c9185b3dc7d46f41, type: 3}
    header: Roll
    body: Move the right joystick left and right to control the drone's roll.
  - option: 3
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 2fc1eecc3a95f284d8871d34dd2e0f21, type: 3}
    header: Throttle
    body: Move the left joystick up and down to control the throttle.
  - option: 5
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: d2c422301862b774e93f93ad555f0175, type: 3}
    header: Yaw
    body: Move the left joystick left and right to control the yaw.
  - option: 6
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: b96945ac7416d834fbe52f57a7636759, type: 3}
    header: Arm
    body: Move the left joystick to the bottom to arm the drone.
  - option: 4
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: d8f528eb5129642428936b2b809ff811, type: 3}
    header: Trigger
    body: Point the controller at the object and press the trigger button to select.
